<p>Attune yourself to the endless hunger of distant dead suns.  For the next <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">3, 4, 5, 6, 7</acronym> turns, your attacks will inflict an additional <acronym class="variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00,<br>spellpower 100">29, 39, 46, 53, 58</acronym> gravity damage and attempt to pull enemies closer.  After three turns, you will recover half of all damage taken during this effect.</p><p>The damage will increase with your Spellpower.</p>